# .trivyignore
#
# RULE-21: every suppression must include:
#   - CVE ID and affected package@version
#   - Why it is not exploitable in this specific usage
#   - Expiry date for review
#
# Format:
#   # CVE-YYYY-NNNNN (package@version)
#   # Reason: [why not exploitable in our usage]
#   # Expires: YYYY-MM-DD
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# No suppressions at Phase 4 scaffold time.
# Add entries here only with written justification — never suppress blindly.
